<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-BLIJLEVENS WINS FIFTH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-BLIJLEVENS WINS FIFTH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>ALMERIA, Spain 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jeroen Blijlevens of the Netherlands won the 210-km fifth stage of the Tour of Spain from Murcia to Almeria on Wednesday. </p>
<p>Laurent Jalabert of France retains the yellow jersey as overall leader.</p>
